WEBVTT

NOTE Ekoleddwa ne faster-whisper base.en; source=videos/Omusomo/Omulwadde wa sukaali/5.2 Okumpi ne obukali bw’okulaba + Okugaba Endabirwamu - PEC_220p.mp4; sourceLang=olulimi Oluganda; omulimu=okuwandiika

1
00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.706
Akatambi kano kalaga engeri y’okukebera endabirwamu ezirabika okumpi n’okugaba.

2
00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.014
Naaba mu ngalo oyambale PPE.

3
00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:16.706
Ojja kwetaaga ekipande ekirabika okumpi, ekkalaamu n’ebiwandiiko ebikwata ku bujjanjabi, endabirwamu z’okusoma ez’enjawulo n’akaguwa akawanvu sentimita 40.

4
00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:19.783
Nnyonnyola ky'ogenda okukola in-game consent.

5
00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:22.860
Omulwadde mutuuze bulungi mu kifo ekirimu omusana omulungi.

6
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:28.629
Kozesa akaguwa okukakasa nti chati ekuumibwa ku bbanga ettuufu erya sentimita 40.

7
00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:32.860
Basabe basome wansi ekipande nga amaaso gombi gakwataganye.

8
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.200
layini entono ennyo gye basobola okusoma obulungi.

9
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.100
Bwe baba tebasobola kusoma layini ya N8 olwo gezaako ne

10
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.371
nga kwogasse n’endabirwamu za diopter sphere 1.5.

11
00:00:41.371 --> 00:00:46.820
Bwe baba bakyatasobola kusoma N8 olwo bakozese amaanyi agaddako aga waggulu

12
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.242
n’ebirala okutuusa lwe basobola okusoma obulungi ebiwandiiko bya N8.

13
00:00:50.242 --> 00:00:52.980
Kakasa nti endabirwamu zikwatagana bulungi ate nga...

14
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.980
omulwadde musanyufu n’endabika yaabwe.
